From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:56:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Docs/ABI/damon: generalize producer_state file description

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon | 8 +++-----
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon b/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon
index ba0b5d83db280..41a4ce49fbd35 100644
--- a/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon
+++ b/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-kernel-mm-damon
@@ -719,11 +719,9 @@ Description:	Writing to and reading from this file sets and gets the type of
 What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/<P>/producer_state
 Date:		Nov 2026
 Contact:	SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
-Description:	Writing 'on' or 'off' to this file makes the report producer be
-		enabled and disabled, respectively.  Writing 'submit' to this
-		file while 'report_type' is 'user_report' makes the producer to
-		generate and submit a report of the type.  Reading from this
-		file gets the enablement state ('on' or 'off').
+Description:	A file for requesting actions including enablement and
+		disablement of the producer.  Refer to
+		Documentation/admin-guide/mm/damon/usage.rst for more details.
 
 What:		/sys/kernel/mm/damon/admin/reports/producers/<P>/addr_start
 Date:		Nov 2026
-- 
2.47.3

